>Phelps</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Rose</surname><given-names>SW</given-names></name></person-group><year>2008</year><article-title>Conceptual model of comprehensive research metrics for improved human health and environment</article-title><source>Environ Health Perspect</source><volume>116</volume><fpage>583</fpage><lpage>592</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18470312</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b7-ehp-117-1147"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Fisher</surname><given-names>ED</given-names></name><name><surname>Strunk</surname><given-names>RC</given-names></name><name><surname>Sussman</surname><given-names>LK</given-names></name><name><surname>Sykes</surname><given-names>RK</given-names></name><name><surname>Walker</surname><given-names>MS</given-names></name></person-group><year>2004</year><article-title>Community organization to reduce the need for acute care for asthma among African American children in low-income neighborhoods: the Neighborhood Asthma Coalition</article-title><source>Pediatrics</source><volume>114</volume><issue>1</issue><fpage>116</fpage><lpage>123</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15231917</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b8-ehp-117-1147"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Inkelas</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Garro</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>McQuaid</surname><given-names>EL</given-names></name><name><surname>Ortega</surname><given-names>AN</given-names></name></person-group><year>2008</year><article-title>Race/ethnicity, language, and asthma care: findings from a 4-state survey</article-title><source>Ann Allergy Asthma Immunol</source><volume>100</volume><issue>2</issue><fpage>120</fpage><lpage>127</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18320913</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b9-ehp-117-1147"><mixed-c